 "y1": 0.4809917355371901}, {"text": "OR", "x0": 0.5080213903743316, "y0": 0.5173553719008265, "x1": 0.5368983957219251, "y1": 0.5272727272727272}, {"text": "(@ Film", "x0": 0.14010695187165775, "y0": 0.5347107438016528, "x1": 0.20748663101604278, "y1": 0.5479338842975207}, {"text": "Peter Weir, The Truman Show", "x0": 0.1411764705882353, "y0": 0.5694214876033058, "x1": 0.39358288770053473, "y1": 0.5818181818181818}, {"text": "Composers utilise the distinctive qualities of their chosen textual form to convey insightful ideas", "x0": 0.14010695187165775, "y0": 0.6033057851239669, "x1": 0.8962566844919786, "y1": 0.6173553719008265}, {"text": "about our world.", "x0": 0.14010695187165775, "y0": 0.6206611570247934, "x1": 0.26844919786096255, "y1": 0.631404958677686}, {"text": "Explain how Peter Weir uses the distinctive qualities of film in The Truman Show to express", "x0": 0.1411764705882353, "y0": 0.6462809917355372, "x1": 0.8652406417112299, "y1": 0.6743801652892562}, {"text": "insightful ideas about media manipulation?", "x0": 0.14010695187165775, "y0": 0.6727272727272727, "x1": 0.47807486631016044, "y1": 0.6867768595041323}, {"text": "OR", "x0": 0.5080213903743316, "y0": 0.7090909090909091, "x1": 0.5368983957219251, "y1": 0.71900826446281}, {"text": "Media", "x0": 0.17005347593582887, "y0": 0.7264462809917356, "x1": 0.22139037433155082, "y1": 0.7363636363636363}, {"text": "Simon Nasht, Frank Hurley: The Man Who Made History", "x0": 0.14010695187165775, "y0": 0.7611570247933884, "x1": 0.613903743315508, "y1": 0.7743801652892562}, {"text": "Explain how The Man Who Made History invites us into a different world and broadens our", "x0": 0.1411764705882353, "y0": 0.8008264462809918, "x1": 0.8577540106951872, "y1": 0.8148760330578513}, {"text": "understanding of our world.", "x0": 0.14010695187165775, "y0": 0.8239669421487603, "x1": 0.3572192513368984, "y1": 0.8380165289256198}, {"text": "In your response, make detailed reference to your prescribed text.", "x0": 0.1411764705882353, "y0": 0.8611570247933884, "x1": 0.6524064171122995, "y1": 0.8752066115702479}, {"text": "End of Question 2", "x0": 0.4481283422459893, "y0": 0.9, "x1": 0.5957219251336898, "y1": 0.912396694214876}], [{"text": "Section III \u2014 Module C: The Craft of Writing", "x0": 0.14010695187165775, "y0": 0.06198347107438017, "x1": 0.5187165775401069, "y1": 0.07603305785123966}, {"text": "20 Marks", "x0": 0.14010695187165775, "y0": 0.09669421487603305, "x1": 0.2192513368983957, "y1": 0.10743801652892562}, {"text": "Attempt Question 3", "x0": 0.14010695187165775, "y0": 0.1140495867768595, "x1": 0.3037433155080214, "y1": 0.128099173553719}, {"text": "Allow about 40 minutes for this section", "x0": 0.14010695187165775, "y0": 0.13140495867768595, "x1": 0.46524064171123, "y1": 0.14214876033057852}, {"text": "Answer both parts of the question in a SEPARATE writing booklet. Extra writing booklets are", "x0": 0.14010695187165775, "y0": 0.15702479338842976, "x1": 0.881283422459893, "y1": 0.18512396694214875}, {"text": "available.", "x0": 0.14010695187165775, "y0": 0.1834710743801653, "x1": 0.21390374331550802, "y1": 0.19421487603305784}, {"text": "Read both Part A and Part B before you begin to answer the question.", "x0": 0.14010695187165775, "y0": 0.21818181818181817, "x1": 0.6855614973262032, "y1": 0.2322314049586777}, {"text": "Your answer will be assessed on how well you:", "x0": 0.14010695187165775, "y0": 0.2537190082644628, "x1": 0.5112299465240642, "y1": 0.26776859504132233}, {"text": "craft language to address the demands of the question", "x0": 0.14010695187165775, "y0": 0.27520661157024795, "x1": 0.5893048128342246, "y1": 0.2892561983471074}, {"text": "language appropriate to audience, purpose and form to shape meaning", "x0": 0.20106951871657755, "y0": 0.29421487603305785, "x1": 0.7497326203208556, "y1": 0.3082644628099174}, {"text": "Question 3 - The Craft of Writing", "x0": 0.14010695187165775, "y0": 0.33140495867768593, "x1": 0.42459893048128344, "y1": 0.34545454545454546}, {"text": "Module C \u2014 20 Marks", "x0": 0.14010695187165775, "y0": 0.36611570247933883, "x1": 0.32192513368983955, "y1": 0.3776859504132231}, {"text": "Question 3 continues on page 10", "x0": 0.38823529411764707, "y0": 0.8082644628099174, "x1": 0.6556149732620321, "y1": 0.8223140495867769}], [{"text": "Question 3 (continued)", "x0": 0.14010695187165775, "y0": 0.06198347107438017, "x1": 0.3240641711229946, "y1": 0.07603305785123966}, {"text": "(a) Compose a short discursive or persuasive piece of writing that incorporates the image as a", "x0": 0.14010695187165775, "y0": 0.1140495867768595, "x1": 0.9037433155080213, "y1": 0.128099173553719}, {"text": "central focus.", "x0": 0.17005347593582887, "y0": 0.13140495867768595, "x1": 0.2737967914438503, "y1": 0.14214876033057852}, {"text": "In your piece of writing incorporate at least TWO language devices that you have explored in", "x0": 0.17005347593582887, "y0": 0.16611570247933885, "x1": 0.9037433155080213, "y1": 0.18016528925619835}, {"text": "your study of Module C.", "x0": 0.17005347593582887, "y0": 0.1834710743801653, "x1": 0.36149732620320857, "y1": 0.1975206611570248}, {"text": "12 marks", "x0": 0.827807486631016, "y0": 0.20165289256198346, "x1": 0.9037433155080213, "y1": 0.2115702479338843}, {"text": "(b) Explain how your writing in part (a) was influenced by one of your Module C prescribed texts.", "x0": 0.14010695187165775, "y0": 0.2537190082644628, "x1": 0.9026737967914439, "y1": 0.26776859504132233}, {"text": "Ensure that you make detailed reference to relevant language devices which you have used.", "x0": 0.17005347593582887, "y0": 0.2884297520661157, "x1": 0.8855614973262033, "y1": 0.30247933884297523}, {"text": "8 marks", "x0": 0.8363636363636363, "y0": 0.3239669421487603, "x1": 0.9037433155080213, "y1": 0.3338842975206612}, {"text": "The prescribed texts for Section III are listed on page 10", "x0": 0.2877005347593583, "y0": 0.8702479338842976, "x1": 0.7561497326203208, "y1": 0.8834710743801653}], [{"text": "The prescribed texts for Section III", "x0": 0.14010695187165775, "y0": 0.08181818181818182, "x1": 0.43315508021390375, "y1": 0.09586776859504133}, {"text": "Prose Fiction", "x0": 0.1411764705882353, "y0": 0.10082644628099173, "x1": 0.24919786096256685, "y1": 0.11074380165289256}, {"text": "Ray Bradbury, The Pedestrian", "x0": 0.2288770053475936, "y0": 0.1347107438016529, "x1": 0.4663101604278075, "y1": 0.1487603305785124}, {"text": "Peter Carey, Report on the Shadow Industry", "x0": 0.2288770053475936, "y0": 0.15206611570247933, "x1": 0.5732620320855615, "y1": 0.16611570247933885}, {"text": "Catherine Cole, Home", "x0": 0.2288770053475936, "y0": 0.16942148760330578, "x1": 0.4021390374331551, "y1": 0.18264462809917356}, {"text": "Stephen King, Crouch End", "x0": 0.2288770053475936, "y0": 0.18677685950413223, "x1": 0.4406417112299465, "y1": 0.20082644628099172}, {"text": "Melissa Lucashenko, Dreamers", "x0": 0.2288770053475936, "y0": 0.20413223140495868, "x1": 0.47593582887700536, "y1": 0.21652892561983472}, {"text": "Non-Fiction", "x0": 0.14010695187165775, "y0": 0.24545454545454545, "x1": 0.23850267379679144, "y1": 0.2553719008264463}, {"text": "Helen Garner, Dear Mrs Dunkley", "x0": 0.2288770053475936, "y0": 0.26694214876033057, "x1": 0.4909090909090909, "y1": 0.2809917355371901}, {"text": "George Orwell, The Sporting Spirit", "x0": 0.2288770053475936, "y0": 0.2900826446280992, "x1": 0.5048128342245989, "y1": 0.30413223140495865}, {"text": "Sylvia Plath, A Comparison", "x0": 0.2288770053475936, "y0": 0.31239669421487604, "x1": 0.4459893048128342, "y1": 0.32644628099173556}, {"text": "Sarah Vowell, What He Said There", "x0": 0.2288770053475936, "y0": 0.33553719008264465, "x1": 0.5037433155080214, "y1": 0.3487603305785124}, {"text": "Speeches", "x0": 0.14010695187165775, "y0": 0.38181818181818183, "x1": 0.21390374331550802, "y1": 0.3950413223140496}, {"text": "Helen Garner, Dear Mrs Dunkley", "x0": 0.2288770053475936, "y0": 0.4033057851239669, "x1": 0.4909090909090909, "y1": 0.41735537190082644}, {"text": "George Orwell, The Sporting Spirit", "x0": 0.2288770053475936, "y0": 0.42644628099173554, "x1": 0.5048128342245989, "y1": 0.44049586776859506}, {"text": "Sylvia Plath, A Comparison", "x0": 0.2288770053475936, "y0": 0.4487603305785124, "x1": 0.4459893048128342, "y1": 0.4628099173553719}, {"text": "Sarah Vowell, What He Said There", "x0": 0.2288770053475936, "y0": 0.471900826446281, "x1": 0.5037433155080214, "y1": 0.48512396694214877}, {"text": "Linda Burney, First speech to the House of Representatives as Member for Barton", "x0": 0.2288770053475936, "y0": 0.49421487603305786, "x1": 0.8737967914438503, "y1": 0.5082644628099173}, {"text": "Steve Jobs, How to Live Before You Die", "x0": 0.2288770053475936, "y0": 0.5173553719008265, "x1": 0.5422459893048128, "y1": 0.531404958677686}, {"text": "Paul Keating, Funeral Service of The Unknown Australian Soldier", "x0": 0.2288770053475936, "y0": 0.5396694214876033, "x1": 0.7497326203208556, "y1": 0.5537190082644629}, {"text": "JK Rowling, The Fringe Benefits of Failure and the Importance of Imagination", "x0": 0.22780748663101605, "y0": 0.5628099173553719, "x1": 0.8545454545454545, "y1": 0.5768595041322314}, {"text": "Poetry", "x0": 0.1411764705882353, "y0": 0.6090909090909091, "x1": 0.1946524064171123, "y1": 0.6223140495867768}, {"text": "Carol Chan, Popcorn", "x0": 0.2288770053475936, "y0": 0.6305785123966943, "x1": 0.39358288770053473, "y1": 0.6446280991735537}, {"text": "Robert Frost, Stopping By Woods on a Snowy Evening", "x0": 0.2288770053475936, "y0": 0.6537190082644628, "x1": 0.6545454545454545, "y1": 0.6677685950413224}, {"text": "Les Murray, An Absolutely Ordinary Rainbow", "x0": 0.2288770053475936, "y0": 0.6760330578512397, "x1": 0.5914438502673797, "y1": 0.6900826446280992}, {"text": "Judith Wright, The Surfer", "x0": 0.22780748663101605, "y0": 0.6991735537190082, "x1": 0.4299465240641711, "y1": 0.7132231404958678}, {"text": "Performance Poetry", "x0": 0.1411764705882353, "y0": 0.7446280991735538, "x1": 0.30802139037433157, "y1": 0.7586776859504132}, {"text": "Luka Lesson, May your pen grace the page", "x0": 0.2288770053475936, "y0": 0.7826446280991736, "x1": 0.5689839572192513, "y1": 0.7966942148760331}, {"text": "End of Question 3", "x0": 0.4481283422459893, "y0": 0.8611570247933884, "x1": 0.5957219251336898, "y1": 0.8735537190082645}, {"text": "End of Paper", "x0": 0.46737967914438505, "y0": 0.9016528925619834, "x1": 0.5775401069518716, "y1": 0.9148760330578513}]]